  "description": "Lightweight, source-generator-powered reactive state management for Blazor and .NET MAUI, with computed state, effects (cancellation, concurrency, debounce, retries, timeouts), middleware, persistence, undo/redo, a server-state query cache, OpenTelemetry tracing and Redux DevTools time-travel. Ships the Roslyn source generator that turns [BlexStore] classes into reactive stores, and the Blazor integration: the BlexComponentBase base class, <BlexProvider>, browser-storage persistence and the Redux DevTools bridge.",
